  "detail_text": "This is a Pre-solicitation notice.Â Solicitation 36C24926R0007 will be issued on or about 20 APRIL 2026. The Department of Veterans Affairs, VISN 9 VA Medical Centers at Lexington, Louisville, Memphis, Mountain Home, TVHS (Nashville and Murfreesboro) have a requirement for teleradiology services. This will be a five year contract term with annual/as needed ordering periods. Â This acquisition is a small disabled veteran owned small business set-a-side and the applicable NAICS Code is 621111 with a size standard of $16 million.Â Point of contact for this request is Ramona Bonness at ramona.bonness@va.gov. All correspondence and responses shall be via e-mail toÂ ramona.bonness@va.gov and shall include the request for proposal numberÂ 36C24926R0007 in the subject line of the email. Telephone requests for information or questions will NOT be accepted. Offerors are responsible for downloading all documents including amendments from Contracting Opportunities at sam.gov website without further notification from the Contracting Officer.",
